  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> be two non-collinear vectors and a triangle <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> with side lengths&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;satisfy the vector equation<br />\r&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>20</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>15</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>×</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math>,<br />\rthen&nbsp;<math><mo>∆</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is"
